+## Paprium fork note (thekoalakoa)
+
+This fork relocates `FB_ADDR` to `0x32000000` and adds `support/megadrive/paprium_pcm.cpp`
+so the Paprium MegaDrive core can **full-preload** `paprium.pcm` (~543 MB) at physical
+`0x10000000`. Bootargs must include `mem=256M memmap=768M$256M`. See
+[Paprium_MiSTer](https://github.com/thekoalakoa/Paprium_MiSTer) docs.
